 "texturesNote": "The .glb embeds everything with film-ready materials (KHR_texture_basisu, KHR_materials_clearcoat/sheen/specular; cards alphaMode MASK; a hidden __variant_<id> mesh per variant whose map is its colour atlas; for a variant also use COLOR_1 (three: geometry attribute color_1) as the cards' and tuft's colour). The same textures ship as separate files: KTX2 is ETC1S everywhere (three's KTX2Loader, transcoder in public/basis/); WebP is the fallback. Colour maps are sRGB with alpha in the bottom strip (the fur-card tiles); normal (tangent space, glTF TANGENT exported) and ORM (R AO, G roughness, B clearcoat mask) are linear and shared by every variant. Every mesh uses TEXCOORD_0; flipY = false.",
